{"articleNo":"2816","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2816&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"학칙 일부개정(안) 의견 조회","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.05.09","hit":"11904","attachments":[{"name":"학칙개정(2011.05.09).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2816&attachNo=2379"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">1. 관련 : 교무연구처-4226(2011.05.09.)<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">2. “금오공과대학교학칙”을 일부 개정함에 있어 그 주요 내용과 취지 등을<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 구성원들에게 미리 알려 이에 대한 의견을 받고자 하오니,<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">3. 붙임 일부개정(안)에 대하여 의견이 있는 경우 아래 양식에 따라 작성하시어&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2011.05.16.(월)까지 교무연구처로 제출하여 주시기 바라며,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 동 기간 내에 회신이 없을 경우에는 이견이 없는 것으로 간주합니다.&nbsp;<br><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;[개정(안) 검토의견서]<br><br></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 소속(단체명) :&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;성명(대표자 성명) :</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle